# Tickets

`tickets/` is the concern queue. Before starting any task, check for `status:
open` / `in-progress` tickets relevant to the request. When Dula describes a
problem in chat, triage it with the routing map in `tickets/README.md`
(symptom → owning component), and file/update the ticket file as part of the
work: status, root cause, component, fix commit. Evidence first: pull the
lead's `messages` rows (`brain_audit`, `voice_call_report` meta kinds) before
changing anything.
